# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------#
# Document: .gitignore
# Description: Global exclusion rules for Coozila! Studio. 
#              Updated to support Root Engine (ComfyUI) & Nested Apps.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------#

# --- 🚀 CLONED APPLICATIONS & SUBMODULES ---
# Allow tracking of the pointers, ignore the local mess inside.
**/node_modules/
**/venv/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock

# --- 🎨 FRONTEND & CANVAS ARTIFACTS ---
# Essential for WebUI and Canvas development.
**/.svelte-kit/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.cache/
**/.turbo/

# --- 💾 PERSISTENT DATA & ASSETS ---
# Protect the "Tank" from committing heavy media.
data/coozila/outputs/*
data/coozila/sessions/*
data/coozila/exports/*
data/coozila/temp_assets/*

# Directory preservation
!data/coozila/outputs/.gitkeep
!data/coozila/sessions/.gitkeep
!data/coozila/exports/.gitkeep

# Global Media Exclusions
*.mp4
*.gif
*.wav
*.mp3
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

# --- 🐍 PYTHON ENVIRONMENT ---
# Aggressive cleanup to match your setup-webui.sh logic.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
.python-version

# --- 🖥️ OS & IDE SPECIFIC ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
.asdf/
.tool-versions